# Tiled sums. A Ready sum of tiled values of the contract holds, at the
# row-major index of the kept axes, the rounded merge of the partials of the
# rows of the reduced axes there: a row is a line of the last axis when it is
# reduced, otherwise one value, and the partials merge in the tree of the other
# reduced axes, outermost first.
